<!-- SECTION 3 -->
<h2>3. Detailed 4-Month Project Lifecycle (August – November 2026)</h2>
<p>
  The project was executed over 16 calendar weeks structured into 8 bi-weekly Sprints. The Project Manager tracked velocity, burn-down rates, blockers, and milestone criteria at every phase.
</p>

<h3>Month 1: August 2026 — Inception, Discovery, UX &amp; Architecture</h3>
<p><em>Focus: Ground truth assessment, stakeholder consensus, bilingual UX prototypes, and architectural foundations.</em></p>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th style="width: 15%;">Sprint / Dates</th>
      <th style="width: 35%;">Sprint Objectives &amp; Work Items</th>
      <th style="width: 30%;">PM Controls &amp; Deliverables</th>
      <th style="width: 20%;">Milestone Status</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Sprint 1</strong><br>(Aug 1 – Aug 14)</td>
      <td>
        <ul>
          <li>Conducted field discovery with Trust coordinators in Pune, Kolhapur, and Beed districts.</li>
          <li>Analyzed 500+ legacy paper application forms to identify required fields, mandatory document proofs, and income thresholds.</li>
          <li>Defined data models for Student Profiles, Academic History, Household Demographics, and Document Verifications.</li>
        </ul>
      </td>
      <td>
        <ul>
          <li>Authored Software Requirements Specification (SRS v1.0).</li>
          <li>Established Risk Register &amp; Communication Plan.</li>
          <li>Set up project workspace, repository, and task backlog.</li>
        </ul>
      </td>
      <td><span class="badge badge-success">M1.1: SRS Approved</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Sprint 2</strong><br>(Aug 15 – Aug 31)</td>
      <td>
        <ul>
          <li>Figma prototyping of mobile and desktop user flows for students and review committee.</li>
          <li>Bilingual terminology dictionary created (English to formal Marathi Devanagari translation).</li>
          <li>Selected modern tech stack: React 19, Vite, React Router 7, Express.js, and Lucide UI.</li>
          <li>Established design tokens: Marathi display typography, warm trust colors (#96281B, #C0392B, #FBF8F1).</li>
        </ul>
      </td>
      <td>
        <ul>
          <li>Conducted Prototype Review with Board of Trustees.</li>
          <li>Finalized Sprint Backlog for core portal development.</li>
          <li>Architecture Decision Records (ADRs) logged.</li>
        </ul>
      </td>
      <td><span class="badge badge-success">M1.2: UX &amp; Architecture Signed Off</span></td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h3>Month 2: September 2026 — Core Development &amp; Application Engine</h3>
<p><em>Focus: Interactive bilingual portal, multi-step application workflow, and real-time application tracking.</em></p>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th style="width: 15%;">Sprint / Dates</th>
      <th style="width: 35%;">Sprint Objectives &amp; Work Items</th>
      <th style="width: 30%;">PM Controls &amp; Deliverables</th>
