          <li>Optimized asset loading, icon tree-shaking, and CSS compression for 3G rural networks.</li>
        </ul>
      </td>
      <td>
        <ul>
          <li>Low-bandwidth network simulation tests (Slow 3G profiles).</li>
          <li>Beta Release deployment to staging environment.</li>
          <li>Preparation of UAT test scenarios and scripts.</li>
        </ul>
      </td>
      <td><span class="badge badge-success">M3.2: Beta Feature Freeze</span></td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h3>Month 4: November 2026 — UAT, Codebase 2.0 Cleanup, Production Deployment</h3>
<p><em>Focus: End-user validation, legacy file pruning, documentation finalization, and operational handover.</em></p>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th style="width: 15%;">Sprint / Dates</th>
      <th style="width: 35%;">Sprint Objectives &amp; Work Items</th>
