    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Sprint 7</strong><br>(Nov 1 – Nov 14)</td>
      <td>
        <ul>
          <li>Executed formal User Acceptance Testing (UAT) with 50+ pilot students and 6 Trust committee members.</li>
          <li>Collected feedback on mobile keypad behaviors for Marathi input and reference ID copying.</li>
          <li>Fine-tuned error messages and added bilingual tooltips for document requirements.</li>
          <li>Finalized performance optimization: 0 accessibility errors, 96+ Lighthouse score.</li>
        </ul>
      </td>
      <td>
        <ul>
          <li>UAT Defect Log triage and 100% resolution.</li>
          <li>Trustee Sign-off on functional and security completeness.</li>
          <li>Operational readiness review checklist.</li>
        </ul>
      </td>
      <td><span class="badge badge-success">M4.1: UAT Sign-off Achieved</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Sprint 8</strong><br>(Nov 15 – Nov 30)</td>
      <td>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Codebase 2.0 Pruning:</strong> Removed 11 obsolete static HTML files, unused backend scripts, duplicate assets, and legacy CSS.</li>
          <li>Version bumped package.json to <code>v2.0.0</code> and finalized Express production static server.</li>
          <li>Configured single-command production build and automated deployment pipelines.</li>
          <li>Authored complete administrative manuals, staff SOPs, and system documentation.</li>
          <li>Conducted operational handover training for Trust office personnel at Pune headquarters.</li>
        </ul>
      </td>
      <td>
        <ul>
          <li>Final Project Retrospective meeting.</li>
          <li>Production deployment cutover verification.</li>
          <li>Formal Project Closure Report and warranty plan handover.</li>
        </ul>
      </td>
      <td><span class="badge badge-success">M4.2: Production v2.0 Live</span></td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
